# prefix-map — id prefix to `repo:` label, for prefixes the mirror can no longer vote for.
#
# reimport-payload.py derives the map from the mirror itself: a file named <rig>.jsonl
# votes its dominant id prefix, so a rig added to Gas Town tomorrow maps itself and this
# file stays empty for it. What it cannot derive is a prefix whose rig has been REMOVED —
# no file votes, the rows survive in the town's convoy trackers, and an unmapped row is
# refused rather than landed with no partition.
#
# Format: <prefix>=<repo>, one per line, `#` comments. No `-` on the prefix.
#
# ho- : home-manager, retired. Two hq-side trackers reference it and nothing exports it.
ho=homemanager
